---
import Full from '../layouts/Full.astro';
---
<Full title="Ormos — Your terminal. Your apps. One local workspace." description="Run Ormos on your machine for browser terminals and localhost app previews. One executable, no hosted account. Use Tailscale for private access from another device.">
<div class="shell"><header><a class="wordmark" href="/">ormos<span> / local workspace</span></a><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#start">Install</a><a href="https://github.com/nicodes/ormos">GitHub ↗</a></nav></header>
<main id="main-content"><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">HOME IS WHERE YOUR SHELL IS</p><h1>Your terminal.<br>Your apps.<br><span>One open window.</span></h1><div class="intro-bottom"><p>Real shells and localhost previews, together in your browser. Ormos runs on your machine as one executable. Your tools and files are already there.</p><a class="button" href="#start">Make yourself at home <span>↘</span></a></div></section>
<section class="workspace" aria-label="Illustrative Ormos workspace"><div class="workspace-label"><span>WORKSPACE / EXAMPLE</span><span>LOCAL → BROWSER</span></div><div class="workspace-grid"><div class="terminal"><div class="pane-title">Terminal 1 <span>+</span></div><pre><span>~/code/studio</span>
$ bun dev

<span>Local: http://localhost:3000/</span>

$ <span class="cursor">▏</span></pre><div class="keys">Keyboard &nbsp; Esc &nbsp; Tab &nbsp; ↑ &nbsp; ↓ &nbsp; Enter <span>Ctrl+C</span></div></div><div class="preview"><div class="pane-title">3000 / <span>↗</span></div><div class="preview-art"><small>YOUR LOCAL APP</small><b>Build it here.<br>Open it there.</b><span class="preview-circle">↗</span></div></div></div><p class="caption">Terminal and preview are separate views in Ormos. This illustration shows both side by side.</p></section>
<section class="features"><article><span>01 / TERMINAL</span><h2>A tab for each thread.</h2><p>Independent shells keep running as you switch views. Rename tabs, save commands, and paste saved prompts into the active terminal.</p></article><article><span>02 / PREVIEW</span><h2>Just enter the port.</h2><p>Try <code>3000</code>, <code>3000/about</code>, or a localhost URL. Ormos forwards the app, including WebSockets and live reload, through a separate preview origin.</p></article><article><span>03 / ANYWHERE</span><h2>A private way back.</h2><p>Local use needs no account or network setup. For another device, keep Ormos on loopback and use Tailscale Serve for private workspace and app access.</p><a href="https://github.com/nicodes/ormos#private-access-through-tailscale">Set up private access ↗</a></article></section>
<section class="start" id="start"><div><p class="eyebrow">LESS SETUP. MORE WORKSPACE.</p><h2>Install.<br>Open.<br>Carry on.</h2><p>Prebuilt releases for Linux and macOS, on x86_64 and arm64. The installer verifies the download and installs to your user bin directory without sudo.</p><a href="https://github.com/nicodes/ormos/releases">Browse releases ↗</a></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01 — INSTALL</span><pre>curl -fsSL https://github.com/nicodes/ormos/raw/main/install.sh | sh</pre></article><article><span>02 — START</span><pre>ormos ui</pre></article><article><span>03 — OPEN THE PRINTED ADDRESS</span><p>Defaults to <code>http://127.0.0.1:4242</code>. Open a terminal tab, run your app, and enter its port in Preview.</p></article><p class="access-note">Ormos has no application login. Keep remote access private: anyone allowed to reach the UI can control its terminals.</p></div></section></main><footer><a class="wordmark" href="/">ormos</a><p>A workspace on your machine.</p><a href="https://github.com/nicodes/ormos#readme">Documentation ↗</a></footer></div></Full>
<style>

.shell { width: min(1200px,calc(100% - 64px)); margin: auto; }
header { min-height: 92px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #b8c3bf; }
a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 5px; } .wordmark { font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -.06em; text-decoration: none; } .wordmark span { font: 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0; margin-left: 12px; color: #465f57; } nav { display: flex; gap: 25px; font-size: 13px; } nav a { text-decoration: none; }
.intro { padding: 72px 0 48px; } .eyebrow { font: 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .12em; color: #315b4d; } h1 { font-size: clamp(56px,7.5vw,104px); line-height: 1.01; letter-spacing: -.045em; font-weight: 650; margin: 30px 0; } h1 span { color: #387c65; } .intro-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 36px; } .intro-bottom p { max-width: 590px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: #465f57; } .button { padding: 18px 25px; background: #183c30; color: #fff; border-radius: 100px; display: inline-flex; gap: 30px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 14px; }
.workspace { border: 1px solid #b8c3bf; padding: 18px; background: #fff; border-radius: 18px; } .workspace-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font: 10px var(--mono); color: #465f57; padding: 4px 4px 18px; } .workspace-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; } .terminal { background: #152b23; color: #edf1e9; border-radius: 8px; min-width: 0; } .pane-title { font: 12px var(--mono); border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff25; padding: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; } .terminal pre { margin: 0; padding: 30px; font: 13px/1.7 var(--mono); overflow-x: auto; } .terminal pre span { color: #b8dba3; } .keys { border-top: 1px solid #ffffff25; padding: 16px; font: 10px var(--mono); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; } .preview { border-radius: 8px; background: #e4edda; } .preview .pane-title { border-color: #b7c6ab; } .preview-art { padding: 36px; } .preview-art small { font: 10px var(--mono); color: #465f57; } .preview-art b { display: block; font: 44px/1.04 Georgia,serif; margin: 20px 0; } .preview-circle { display: block; width: 40px; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid #79947f; border-radius: 50%; } .caption { font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono); color: #465f57; padding: 0 4px; }
.features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 40px; padding: 88px 0; } .features article > span,.steps article > span { font: 11px var(--mono); color: #387c65; } h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.04em; } .features p,.start p { color: #465f57; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; } .features a,.start a { font-size: 13px; } code { font-family: var(--mono); }
.start { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 80px; padding: 60px 0 85px; border-top: 1px solid #b8c3bf; } .start h2 { font: 64px/1.02 Georgia,serif; margin: 20px 0; } .steps { min-width: 0; } .steps article { border-bottom: 1px solid #b8c3bf; padding: 24px 0; } .steps pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: 12px/1.7 var(--mono); background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; } .access-note { border-left: 3px solid #387c65; padding-left: 16px; } footer { min-height: 100px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid #b8c3bf; gap: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #465f57; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 55px 0; } .start { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; } .intro-bottom { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; } }
@media (max-width: 600px) { .shell { width: calc(100% - 32px); } header { min-height: 76px; } .wordmark span { display: none; } nav { gap: 16px; } .intro { padding-top: 42px; } h1 { font-size: 53px; } .intro-bottom p { font-size: 16px; } .workspace-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .workspace { padding: 10px; } .preview-art b { font-size: 37px; } .workspace-label { font-size: 9px; gap: 12px; } footer { flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 28px 0; } }

</style>
